:false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-03-04T03:40:39Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T14:24:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4 COMPATABILITY mode\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6614) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-13700K (24 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using Compatibility mode (and not mobile or Forward+) if you are in Maximized mode and change your window size, the mouse position will become desynced to your cursor.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nMake empty project in compatibility mode\nSet window to Maximized\nChange window resolution]\nMouse position will now be above or bellow the cursor position\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[new-game-project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19063668/new-game-project.zip)\nGodot icon is where mouse position is. Click button to change window size.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103549/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103549/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"p